# L §4.4, §5.18 (tally 2.1.8 R13, #186): a ledger under windows each whose lines differ by sub-window prints one
# block per run of sub-windows that agree, each under its head, then its lines; one unlabelled block where all
# agree. `one` lands on 2026-03-30, 2026-03-31 or 2026-04-01: April's ledger agrees over the first two days (q), and
# February's over all three (q2). 2.1.7's refcore printed the first day's lines unlabelled; the engine stopped "not
# built".
=== m.tally
model pw
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-25
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input dk: date
input dd: int

move one: transfers
  on dk
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dd)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "s"
  dd = 10 "s"
  dk = window(2026-03-30, 2026-04-01) "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q: residuals konto 2026-04 windows each
ask q2: residuals konto 2026-02 windows each

version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-02..2026-04
  known 2026-04-01
  covers konto
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-10, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to konto amount 12.00 PLN) "r1"
=== expect
q [dk = 2026-03-30 .. 2026-03-31]: residuals konto 2026-04
  2026-04 move pay: model 10.00 PLN, observed 0.00 PLN, difference -10.00 PLN
    expected but missing pay[2026-04] on 2026-04-10: model 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-25
q [dk = 2026-04-01]: residuals konto 2026-04
  2026-04 move one: model 10.00 PLN, observed 0.00 PLN, difference -10.00 PLN
    expected but missing one on 2026-04-01: model 10.00 PLN
  2026-04 move pay: model 10.00 PLN, observed 0.00 PLN, difference -10.00 PLN
    expected but missing pay[2026-04] on 2026-04-10: model 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-25
q2: residuals konto 2026-02
  2026-02 move pay: model 10.00 PLN, observed 0.00 PLN, difference -10.00 PLN
    expected but missing pay[2026-02] on 2026-02-10: model 10.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-25
